    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing these wiring diagrams freely; commercial use requires prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Blade poles model toggle logic, not physical terminals. Generic series humbuckers omit lead colors, polarity, electrical values, bridge ground, cable, and load; red/white joins are coil links. Logical pot lugs and linear scale omit physical orientation and audio taper. PDF 0.047 uF caps map to 47 nF. Two tone branches make the estimate unavailable."
